WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:05.320
Hi, my name is Michael, and I'm from Central City...I mean..

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:06.200
Tom: Nailed It!

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:14.500
(inaudible), California, so I was just wondering, you guys have introduced a lot of speedsters to the show

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:21.060
Like, Jay Garrick, Wally West, Jessie Quick? Are you gonna introduce Bart Allen?

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:22.500
And how would you do it?

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:33.040
Todd Helbing: Uhh...(clears throat) I mean we haven't...uh..as of now we're not but.. um..

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:37.260
it's, you know, it's the Flash, so, um, anything's possible.

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:50.060
Hey, what's up, guys? It's Spencer. (Candice: Hi!) My question is kind of a crossover question between Legends and the Flash.

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:55.400
How critically will Barry's decisions play a role in Legends and vice versa?

00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:01.940
Todd Helbing: Uhh...it's, y'know, it's all one universe so they all have ripples

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:08.420
But those guys are travelling through time, y'know, on their own missions, so, um, they're kinda in their own timeline too.

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:15.260
Um, it's really..(stutters)..what we're showing is really affecting Arrow, so you'll see it on that side mostly.

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:15.760
Audience Member: Thanks!

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:30.240
Hi guys, I'm Kylie, I'm from San Diego and my question...my question was..

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:37.100
If you weren't cast as the role you played, what character would you like to play?

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:40.000
Grant: On the same show? On Flash?

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:40.500
Kylie: Yep

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:41.300
Grant: Cool

00:01:41.860 --> 00:01:43.340
(Laughter)

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:45.760
Grant: Cisco? (laughter)

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:47.540
Jesse: I was gonna say Cisco too.(more laughter)

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.180
Danielle: Me too!! (more laughter)

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:53.160
Carlos: I wanna be like Harry, I think that's a great character

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:54.560
Tom Cavanagh: So we'll still have those interactions

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:59.200
(more laughter) Carlos: Exactly. We would just be flipped-flopped. (inaudible)

00:01:59.200 --> 00:01:59.700
Tom C: Flop-flipping

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:02.900
Tom C(cont'd): Thanks for having us in San Diego, by the way

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:04.900
Danielle: Thank you. (audience cheers)

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:08.160
(Applause)

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:11.600
So, and this is, uh, this is gonna be the last question, so, okay.

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:12.680
Grant: Sick Cow(?)

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:13.180
This is it (chortles)

00:02:13.460 --> 00:02:14.880
Grant: Cool mask, bro

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:25.680
Hi, um, my name's Chris, I'm from Lamorta(?), California. I just wanna ask, how did it feel to work with Kevin Smith?

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:26.960
Flash Panel: Arghh...

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:27.460
Grant: The best

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:28.920
Carlos: He is the man!

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:32.220
Grant: Yeah, the best. Yeah, he's just the most genuine guy.

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:37.360
Tom C: Yeah, that's a tremendous question to end it on, 'cos we, I think, collectively, just think of (the) world of Kevin Smith

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:41.140
and should all you people who don't like, just(?) (cheers and applause)

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:44.020
Tom C: Yeah, yeah, well deserved applause, he's tremendous, we love working with him.

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:46.960
Grant: Yeah, I mean, we worked with him towards the end of the season and he....

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:51.180
It's a long season and we love our job but we're tired at the end of the season, and the crew's tired

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:55.960
And he(Kevin Smith) came in and he uplifted everyone's spirits, and that's not a director's job.

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:57.480
But he did it, that was impressive

00:02:57.480 --> 00:03:02.360
Carlos: I mean, like right before we would do a take, he would say: "Alright, best job in the world (claps hands), let's go!"

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:02.920
Let's do it!

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:06.700
Carlos: That speaks to what a "mensch" that guy is

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:07.200
Tom: And...

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:07.880
Danielle: What a mensch

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:12.160
Tom C: And (in) this universe, how much he's..how much he's respected..and all he's accomplished

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:17.140
Tom C: Just a quick nugget, one of the greatest moments I've seen on set, in our entire 2+ seasons

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:23.080
(cont') was when Kevin saw Grant in the Flash suit for the first time, and Kevin took 3 steps back and teared up

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:23.580
Grant: Teared up

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:25.260
Tom C : And needed to...started to hyperventilate

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:27.780
He's like: " Woah, it's my first time seein' this suit."

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:31.140
(laughter) Grant: We took a picture together before we even like shot the scene

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:33.680
He like needed a picture with me and like in the suit

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:37.280
Tom C: If it makes you excited about what you do

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:38.060
Grant: Yeah, he's awesome

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:45.980
Okay, so, as for you guys the actors, now that the Flarrowverse has grown so big, down the line

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:49.560
What show would you love to take your character to for a visit ?

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:55.900
Keiynan: Erm, I think Legends will be cool because of the time travel, you get to wear a bunch of different stuff.

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:57.620
See Michael Jackson, maybe? That'd be cool!

00:03:57.620 --> 00:03:58.420
(laughter)

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:02.680
Candice: Erm, I think for Iris going to Supergirl over Catco (audience cheers)

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:07.980
Listen, I would never turn down an opportunity to work with Calista Flockhart

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:13.900
Jesse: I was gonna say the same thing, I would really like to reunite on-screen with Calista Flockhart

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:14.740
(audience cheers and applause)

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:23.020
Grant: Erm, well, I've done 'em all, except for Legends, I wanna do Legends, and I have the deepest love for Victor Garber. I miss being on set with that man.

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:24.240
Carlos: Um-hm

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:26.340
Tom C: Victor Garber

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:27.320
Grant: Yeah, man!

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:27.820
Tom C: Yeah

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:30.460
Grant: Did I just sell you on Legends? (chuckles)

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:31.540
Tom: Is Walking Dead part of it?

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:32.740
Tom C and Grant: No no no

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:33.320
(Panel and audience laughs)

00:04:33.320 --> 00:04:33.820
*Grant whispers to Tom C*

00:04:33.820 --> 00:04:34.380
Tom C: What?

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:36.800
What? Is it really? Oh that's weird..(lol)

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:38.640
Tom C: Er..Danielle?

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:40.420
(more laughter)

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:45.600
Danielle: Erm, I want to go to Supergirl too, hang out with those awesome ladies.

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:46.540
(more cheering and applause)

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:55.480
Carlos: I mean, yeah, for curiosity's sake, Supergirl, but if we're goin' outside the universe, and breaking the rules a little bit, I'm gonna go with Rick &amp; Morty

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:59.080
(laughter, cheers and applause)

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:01.700
Carlos: Yes.

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:11.160
Felton: I'll second that, erm, yeah, I was curious to see what Supergirl would be like.

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:17.100
Host: Well, maybe you'll all have a chance. Thank you, guys, you were an incredible crowd.

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:19.060
Let's give it up for The Flash!!

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:20.700
(cheers and applause)

